    "camera_facing_equipment"
  ],
  "validationStatus": "18/18 corrected builds in Blender 5.2.2 LTS passed two-hand checks. Every evaluated mesh is closed manifold, has positive signed volume and no zero-area faces; sole minimum Z=0. Evaluated triangles 896-1414. Forty-five nonproduction renders (I/III/VI in front/back/left/right/three-quarter) completed and visually reviewed after tapered hat/mitre, sloping brim, chunky antler and integrated short cape corrections. Structural report: output/design/hooded-turnarounds-v3/caster-correction-structural-check.json. Pixel IoU/landmark acceptance and final registered render/export comparison remain unclaimed.",
